BT 1 0 0 1 0 84 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .2 .254902 .333333 rg (1. Farmer fills out crop registration form in Flask.) Tj  T* (2. Backend generates unique Batch ID: TH-APPLES-001.) Tj  T* (3. Normalizes payload into deterministic JSON: {batch_id, farmer_id, farming_method, image, name, packaging_date, quantity}.) Tj  T* (4. Computes SHA-256 digest: e.g., 0x9f83b... \(64 hex characters\).) Tj  T* (5. Web3 module builds transaction for TrustHarvestV2.storeHash\(batchId, hash\).) Tj  T* (6. Server signs transaction with farmer's private key \(FARMER_PRIVATE_KEY\) and broadcasts to EVM.) Tj  T* (7. Transaction mined in block; transaction receipt records block number, gas used, and signer address.) Tj  T* (8. Product record saved in PostgreSQL/SQLite along with an immutable StageSnapshot of initial values.) Tj T* ET
