BT 1 0 0 1 0 84 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .2 .254902 .333333 rg (1. Shopper in Seattle points smartphone camera at apple crate QR code; navigates to /verify/TH-APPLES-001.) Tj  T* (2. Verification Engine triggers inspect_batch_on_chain\(\):) Tj  T* (a. Reads on-chain harvest hash via contract.functions.getRecord\(batchId\).call\(\).) Tj  T* (b. Re-calculates local database harvest hash; compares byte-for-byte.) Tj  T* (c. Reads on-chain stage count via contract.functions.getStageCount\(batchId\).call\(\).) Tj  T* (d. Sequentially loops through on-chain stage history and re-computes each transport/retail record from DB.) Tj  T* (e. Validates on-chain recordedBy addresses against expected role signers.) Tj  T* (3. All digests match -> Renders Verified Green Badge, interactive journey stepper, temperature graphs, and EVM block Explorer links.) Tj T* ET
